# Free the Fae: "Mill four cards. Then put an instant, sorcery, or Faerie card from among the milled cards into your hand." Bot1 mills Lightning Bolt (instant),
# Unearth (sorcery), Brazen Borrower (a Faerie creature card) and Bonecrusher Giant (an Adventurer card, which is no instant or sorcery card in a graveyard,
# CR 715.4, and no Faerie) and takes the Faerie card; the other three stay in the graveyard and the fifth card of the library is not touched.

